&lt;li&gt;Weitere Sprachkenntnisse (Französisch oder Spanisch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because work and life are connected, our benefits are too. We’ve designed them to give you the security, flexibility, and opportunities you need to focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 &lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive health benefits&lt;/strong&gt; for you and your dependents, including access to OpenUp for personalized mental health support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Learning and development &lt;/strong&gt;opportunities including an annual learning budget, access to self-paced learning platforms and language training, personalized coaching, mentorship, and leadership programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 &lt;strong&gt;Family Leave Plus&lt;/strong&gt; gives you additional fully paid weeks of parental leave on top of government-provided leave, so you can spend more time with your new addition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Our equity participation program&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to share in our success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/our-benefits&quot;&gt;visit this page.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are. Build with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your unique perspective is essential to our success. We are committed to building a team that reflects the world around us because we know it’s the only way to build the future. We celebrate our differences and have created a hiring process that’s fair, inclusive, and designed to let your talent shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proudly welcome applicants of every race, color, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, and any other part of your identity that makes you who you are. As an equal opportunity employer, we believe that our strength lies in our diversity, and we invite you to be a part of our global community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging practices, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/dei-esg&quot;&gt;visit this page&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SumUp | Product &amp;amp; Design | London, United Kingdom&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive salary · Office-first&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role does not support Visa sponsorship and candidates must have the right to work in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Consumer Bank squad sits at the heart of one of SumUp&#39;s most exciting growth bets — scaling SumUp Pay, our consumer fintech product, to millions of active users across Europe. The team owns end-to-end UX and product design across the full user lifecycle, from onboarding and activation through to engagement features like Spaces, Open Banking insights, and budget tracking. This is a high-craft, high-autonomy environment where design isn&#39;t just execution — it&#39;s central to defining the problems worth solving, and your work will directly shape adoption, retention, and the future of SumUp&#39;s consumer offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end product design within the Consumer Bank squad, from discovery through to delivery, across the SumUp Pay mobile experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery by identifying user problems, framing opportunities, and shaping hypotheses alongside Product and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design intuitive, high-quality mobile experiences in Figma that drive key metrics including activation, engagement, and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate solutions through prototyping, user research, and usability testing, using both qualitative and quantitative data to iterate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design system and help maintain consistency and quality across the product as SumUp scales its consumer offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Senior Product Designer working on mobile-first consumer products, with a portfolio demonstrating end-to-end UX design and measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery skills, including problem framing, hypothesis definition, user research, and insight synthesis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent UX, interaction, and information design skills, with a high bar for quality and usability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working autonomously within cross-functional teams alongside Product Managers and Engineers, with solid understanding of technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage AI design tools (e.g. for ideation, prototyping, and research synthesis) to accelerate workflows and elevate the quality of outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Figma and experience contributing to or evolving design systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our central London Bridge location. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Health matters: private health insurance, including optical and dental&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 Life made easier: salary-sacrifice commuter benefits via Gogeta&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial security: retirement scheme (SumUp matches 7% when you contribute 5%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛡️ Peace of mind: life insurance from MetLife for 2× your salary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎬 Want to see more of life at SumUp? Explore our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/sumup/Global-Employer-Brand-video-library-Empowering-Talent-Acquisition-partners-and-hiring-managers-194d3d97eb3c4eaca7ee2edff1a9d3fd&quot;&gt;Global Employer Brand video library&lt;/a&gt; to add to your job post or create LinkedIn posts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Workato&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Workato is the leading Control and Execution Platform for Enterprise AI — the neutral platform enterprises trust to put AI to work across their business. Workato unifies data, applications, and processes into a single platform so AI can reliably orchestrate business processes in production at enterprise scale. Built on more than a decade of running mission-critical processes for over half the Fortune 500 — including Nasdaq, Amazon, Cisco, Vodafone, Atlassian, and Lucid Motors — Workato turns over 14,000 enterprise systems AI needs to act on into one governed execution layer. For more information, visit &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.workato.com/&quot; data-tooltip-link-label=&quot;undefined&quot;&gt;workato.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Ultimately, Workato believes in fostering a &lt;strong&gt;flexible, trust-oriented culture that empowers everyone to take full ownership of their roles&lt;/strong&gt;. We are driven by &lt;strong&gt;innovation &lt;/strong&gt;and looking for&lt;strong&gt; team players &lt;/strong&gt;who want to actively build our company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;But, we also believe in &lt;strong&gt;balancing productivity with self-care&lt;/strong&gt;. That’s why we offer all of our employees a vibrant and dynamic work environment &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;http://www.workato.com/careers&quot;&gt;along with a multitude of benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; they can enjoy inside and outside of their work lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;If this sounds right up your alley, please submit an application. We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;Also, feel free to check out why:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.businessinsider.com/47-enterprise-startups-to-bet-your-career-on-in-2020-2019-12&quot;&gt;Business Insider&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; named us an “enterprise startup to bet your career on”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/cloud100/#a57477b5f941&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Cloud 100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; recognized us as one of the top 100 private cloud companies in the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://www2.deloitte.com/us/en/pages/technology-media-and-telecommunications/articles/fast500-winners.html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Deloitte Tech Fast 500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us as the 17th fastest growing tech company in the Bay Area, and 96th in North America&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot;&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 55, 99);&quot; href=&quot;https://qz.com/work/2053446/the-best-companies-for-working-from-home/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 212, 216);&quot;&gt;Quartz&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ranked us the #1 best company for remote workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a visionary &lt;strong&gt;Regional Chief Strategic Architect &lt;/strong&gt;to serve as Workato&#39;s technical authority and strategic advisor to our most critical prospects, customers, and the broader market within their assigned region. The Chief Strategic Architect operates at the nexus of technical credibility, executive influence, and market thought leadership, acting as the external-facing voice of Workato&#39;s innovation and technical vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is not a sales role. It is a strategic, hybrid operator-advisor-influencer position. Chief Strategic Architects act as extensions of the executive team in the field, elevating conversations with senior leaders and positioning Workato as the essential platform for enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and intelligent automation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is accountable for building technical trust across the customer lifecycle - from initial engagement through strategic expansion - while simultaneously shaping how the market understands enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and intelligent automation. The Chief Strategic Architect influences deal outcomes, product direction, and industry perception, ensuring Workato is recognized as the definitive leader in Enterprise Orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn &amp;amp; Align (Days 0-30)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep immersion into Workato&#39;s AI vision, product roadmap, and GTM strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shadow at least 10 executive customer conversations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop initial point of view for engagement with CIO/CTO/CDO personas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage &amp;amp; Formulate (Days 30-60)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead first strategic engagements with enterprise accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-develop executive playbooks with Sales and Product teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish feedback loops with Product and Engineering teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Scale (Days 60-90)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cultivate trusted relationships with C-level executives in 5+ strategic accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-create first AI-driven integration use cases with customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish thought leadership presence through content and speaking opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Trust &amp;amp; Executive Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engage directly with C-level executives (CIOs, CTOs, Chief Data Officers, Chief AI Officers) at enterprise accounts to shape integration strategies that solve complex business challenges&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as trusted technical advisor throughout the customer lifecycle - from initial engagement through expansion - providing strategic guidance rooted in real-world operator experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build lasting peer-to-peer relationships that position you as the go-to expert on enterprise integration, AI orchestration, and automation at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as technical closer in competitive deals, articulating why Workato&#39;s architecture differentiates us from competitors like MuleSoft and Boomi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence enterprise architecture decisions and multi-year technology strategies at the executive level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, Agentic Automation &amp;amp; Enterprise MCP Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape and guide customers&#39; AI and agentic automation journeys, leveraging Workato&#39;s AI capabilities and ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise on the design and adoption of agent-based workflows, human-in-the-loop models, and decision automation frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with customer executives to define enterprise MCP (Model Context Protocol) strategies including context management, secure AI orchestration, and governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate emerging AI capabilities into practical, scalable enterprise use cases that drive measurable business outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position Workato as the integration and orchestration backbone for enterprise AI transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise &amp;amp; Thought Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish yourself as the recognized authority across iPaaS, API Management (APIM), data orchestration, EDI, and AI/Agentic automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead &quot;Art of the Possible&quot; workshops that fundamentally shift how customers think about enterprise integration and intelligent automation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent Workato at industry conferences, customer advisory boards, analyst briefings, and partner events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create high-impact thought leadership content: blogs, white papers, webinars, reference architectures, and technical videos&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape industry narratives and best practices that establish Workato as the category leader&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Acceleration &amp;amp; Commercial Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accelerate deal velocity through technical validation, competitive differentiation, and executive trust-building&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and shape strategic expansion opportunities by uncovering automation, integration, and AI-driven transformation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Account Executives and Sales Leadership on account strategy, competitive positioning, and C-level engagement tactics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Articulate compelling ROI narratives and business case frameworks that accelerate buying decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrate measurable impact on win rates, deal size, and sales cycle length in strategic opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Advisory &amp;amp; Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead high-impact customer engagements requiring executive-level judgment, architectural vision, and industry expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guide prospects and customers through Enterprise Orchestration vision and roadmap development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop prioritization frameworks for integration, automation, and AI use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead technology evaluation and vendor selection processes with enterprise customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design governance, scalability, and enterprise operating models for automation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Influence &amp;amp; Market Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the voice of the customer to Product and Engineering teams, channeling field insights into actionable roadmap input&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify capability gaps, competitive threats, and market opportunities based on executive-level customer conversations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and refine competitive positioning, objection handling, and differentiation strategies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define reusable patterns, reference architectures, and technical frameworks that accelerate customer success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence industry analysts and thought leaders to strengthen Workato&#39;s market position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Enablement &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Educate and enable Sales Engineers, Account Executives, and Customer Success teams on complex technical capabilities and emerging trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop strategic frameworks, competitive positioning, and executive engagement playbooks for enterprise accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentor technical team members, helping them develop deeper domain expertise and executive engagement skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create scalable technical enablement content and programs that amplify your expertise across the field organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive customer reference creation and participation in case studies, speaking opportunities, and advisory boards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Experience / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;20+ years of technology transformation experience, including integration, middleware, or API management platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;15+ years in an Enterprise Architect, CTO, VP Engineering, or similar senior architecture/leadership role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience advising C-level executives on technology strategy and enterprise transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise security, governance, and operating models&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
