&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3318&quot; data-local-id=&quot;62eadc8a8a51&quot;&gt;Identify gaps or ambiguities in operational ownership and work with the relevant stakeholders to establish practical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
